+    ) -> None:
+        """WAVE STREAMING. Record one step in which wave `wave_idx` of request
+        `req_id` made no progress, for `reason` "promote_refused" (the primary
+        tier refused staging) or "miss" (a staged key left the primary tier
+        before its load, so the wave is re-staged).
