+        Every retry is counted in vllm:kv_offload_wave_retry{reason}. The log
+        warns only for a wave that looks stuck: at MAX_WAVE_PROMOTE_RETRIES and
+        at every doubling of it, because retries are unbounded (OPEN A) and a
+        warning per ordinary contended step would scale with load.
